## HeartFirst Clarify — Complete Build Summary

### What was built

A **local-first, responsive web application** with five working stages and a full outputs hub:

| Stage | What it does | Key features |
|-------|-------------|--------------|
| **Welcome** | Product introduction with disclaimer | Start/resume, privacy note |
| **Stage 1** | Who needs clarity | Self or loved-one, name/age/sex, multiple person support |
| **Stage 2** | What do we know | 5 accordion sections (Measurements, Lifestyle, Medical History, Family History, Other Factors), "I don't know" checkboxes on every field, badge counters |
| **Stage 3** | Unknown or unclear | Auto-populated gaps from Stage 2, priority (Low/Medium/High), how-to-find-out, manual additions |
| **Stage 4** | Needs discussion | Discussion points with urgency, linked unknowns, who should be present |
| **Stage 5** | What happens next | Decisions with nested actions, completion tracking, appointment details, due dates |
| **Outputs** | 6 printable outputs | Heart Risk Audit, Missing-Info Summary, Discussion Brief, Decision Record, People You Love Follow-Up, Take-Forward Pack |

### Architecture decisions
- **Zustand + localStorage** — no account, no backend, all data in the browser
- **Single-page** — all stages rendered client-side on `/`
- **Privacy-first** — PII separate from health data, per-person toggle controls for sharing
- **Print CSS** — dedicated `@media print` rules hide UI chrome and show only output content

### Verified in browser
- Welcome screen → Stage 1 form → Stage 2 measurements → Stage 3 auto-unknowns → Stage 4 discussion → Stage 5 decisions → Outputs hub with all 6 outputs, privacy controls, and print buttons
- Mobile responsive navigation (compact labels on 375px)
- localStorage persistence confirmed
- Sticky footer with disclaimer
- Clean lint, zero runtime errors